WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:09.250
I asked you for a retake
on my Crisis Management form, didn't I?

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.040
And that's exactly what I did.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.250
What part did you actually change?!

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.080
The first time you transformed,
you told me that your stomach felt cold, so...

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.620
...I fixed up the area around your belly button
and thighs with some warmer fabric!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.700
You hardly changed anything!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.500
That's not the problem at all!
It's embarrassing for me to show so much skin!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.160
I'd prefer to just use my gym clothes!
They're easy to move in and plenty warm!

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.540
But why?

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.120
That's my line. Why is this so hard for you to understand?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.830
The fact is that we gain more power by showing off
more skin, it's an issue in our bloodline.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.080
Who came up with that idea?!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.000
This is becoming a big pain, so I'm just going
to revert it back to normal next time.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.790
When I have to rush to transform you, it's easy to
screw up how many parts there are and where they go.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.000
Don't get so irritated! Please do your best, Ancestor!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.620
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.580
Taiyou mabushisugite

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.410
(Chikachika me o kosutta)

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:12.330
Omowazu tobidashita yo

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.870
(Dokidoki no hajimiari sa)

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:20.620
Yurayura yureru maegami hidarite de osaetara

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:25.200
Itsumo no keshiki ga kirameku yo

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.410
(Three, two, one)

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.450
Ima sugu tsutaetai futari no himitsu

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:37.950
Watashitachi nara dekiru yo

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.950
(Itsumo tonari ni ite)

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.950
Kitto

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.620
(Shijiteru kara)

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:46.620
Machikado de mitsuketa daiji na takaramono

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:52.410
Tatoe kimi ga tooku hanaretemo kanarazu oikakeru yo

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:58.500
Zutto kagayaiteru mirai wa koko ni aru

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:03.700
Otanoshimi wa kore kara

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Final Exams!!
Today I'm One of Those Brainy Demons!!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:32.200
Shamiko! Is something on your mind?

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.200
Yeah, I'm having trouble.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:38.040
Let me guess... by the look on your face,
you're having trouble deciding on what to eat first!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:38.910
That's not it!

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:42.870
I was thinking about what ways I could get Momo
to acknowledge me as a strong ally.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:45.950
I get the feeling that she's taking me too lightly.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.040
Wow. You sure put a lot of thought into things, Shamiko.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.660
But I haven't made much progress
on building my stamina, so I still have a long way to go.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:56.830
It's true that you don't have much stamina, but I think
you have a lot of room for improvement elsewhere.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:57.660
Like up here.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.290
Up... here?

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.660
Presenting: Stag-Beetle Shamiko!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:07.700
Presenting: Stag-Beetle Shamiko!!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.580
You mean grow out my horns more?!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.700
Nope.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.620
I'm telling you to use your head
to become a brainy demon.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.040
Final Exams

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.040
Hey, Momo!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.870
The final exams before summer vacation
are coming up, so I demand that we have a duel!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.000
A duel?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.040
I thought we had a ceasefire right now.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.700
Our bloody feud with each other is in
a totally different category from a friendly duel!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.950
Shamiko was telling me that she feels depressed
because you haven't been taking her very seriously.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.750
So, she wants to beat you in a duel of wits
and get you to think better of her!

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:33.040
Shamiko was crying about it earlier
while poking at her lunch of plain rice.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.700
She said, "I get no side dishes and no love!"

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.660
I said no such thing!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.160
Stop blowing everything out of proportion!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.370
Okay, but just so you know my grades are pretty good.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.500
What is that?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.870
It's my scores from the midterm exams.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.250
I left it crammed in my desk.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.450
Wait, you just let your exam scores
get crumpled up like an accordion?!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:52.500
So careless!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.370
I don't think the inside of your desk
is in any better shape, Shamiko.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.330
96 points, 90 points, 88 points, 100 points?!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:04:01.040
Points

00:03:56.660 --> 00:04:01.040
Points

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:01.040
Points

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.040
Points

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.040
All of these high scores in the science sections...

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:05.580
So there's more in that head of yours
than just protein and chicken.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.000
It's weird because you're normally
such a huge mess otherwise.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.410
Was that your impression of me this whole time?

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.540
So, you want a friendly duel?

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.830
If I win, will you give up on having a fun summer
vacation and immerse yourself totally in training?

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.750
Momo, are you mad at me?

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:20.950
Not at all.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.370
Hey, Shamiko. What were your scores like
on the midterm exams?

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:28.080
Well... I tried really hard on all the fine arts sections
and got around 70 points.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.250
But for the sciences, I totally bombed.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.290
Uh, that's bad.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.250
Say Momochi, are there any subjects
that you're bad at?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.290
I suppose out of all of them I'm lacking most in history.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.750
I got about 75 points there.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.620
Okay, how about you make
this a duel based on your world history scores?

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.080
Roger
that!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.660
Roger that!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.040
Hmmm...

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.700
Hmmm...

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:48.910
To make up for the handicap, Shamiko will agree to
dumbbell lifts 100 x however many points she loses by!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.040
That sounds fair.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.040
I don't think we should be putting any bets
on a friendly duel!

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.000
I can't believe Momo has good grades...
I never would have guessed.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.870
It's fine, all you have to do is win.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:03.660
If you go into this thinking that you're going to lose,
you really will lose!

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:08.580
The topics for world history on the final exam will be:
Ancient Egypt, Mesopotamia, Greece...

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.160
Did you say Mesopotamia?!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.160
Egypt and Mesopotamia are right up my alley!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.330
Back then I was at the peak of my glory days!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.410
It was just around when I got sealed away,
so everything felt fresh and I wasn't such a sore loser!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:21.200
That's what you consider your glory days?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:26.950
After I was sealed away, my statue was passed around
to a lot of folks and I got to explore the orient!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.950
My powers were nearly drained
so I spent a lot of time sleeping, but...

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.040
I was pretty famous around those parts!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.370
Just looking at this textbook, I can tell you
I was friends with this guy and that guy!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.000
Th-that's incredible!
What kind of person was this guy like?

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:41.370
He used me to hold down a stack of papyrus...

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.450
Sob, sob.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.290
Sob, sob, sob.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.700
Don't cry, Ancestor!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:47.660
I agree with what you said before!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.160
I can't go into this thinking that I'll lose.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.160
All I have to do is win, it's simple!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.250
Yep, yep!

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:08.330
Dog

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.370
Dog

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:26.870
Tomorrow is the test, but I haven't been able
to remember anything.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.620
Good grief, you really have no idea
how to be efficient about anything.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.290
Do you want me to pitch in and help?

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.750
All you have to do is take the test while I
communicate with you in your head, just like this.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.500
Is this telepathy?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.700
Indeed. And I know all there is to know
about Mesopotamia and Egypt, remember?

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:44.250
Just smuggle my statue into the test with you
and I'll help you get the answers!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.580
We'll call it... Operation: Ancestor Answers!

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.620
ANCESTOOR!
ANSWERS

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.000
That's not an operation, it's just plain cheating!

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.700
No way!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.160
It's a perfectly valid way to apply
your unique powers as a Demon Girl!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.120
Not happening!

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.370
Cheating is something we must never do!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.500
You haven't forgotten that we're Demons, right?

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.910
We're aligned with the darkness. Chaos is our
fundamental source of nourishment that gives us power.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.120
I-is that really true?

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.700
When you said that you wanted to make Momo
acknowledge you, I thought it was a good opportunity.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.500
You can overwhelm Momo and totally unsettle her.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.200
If you do that and manage
to strip her heart free of its armor,

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:22.120
it will ultimately make it easier to use our clan's power
to invade her dreams!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.950
All you have to do is cheat, I mean,
use your totally natural Demon powers!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:30.330
Then it will bring success in the future, ensuring
the revival of our clan and your family's happiness!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.290
"My family's happiness"?

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:35.830
Don't you want your little sister to live a life of luxury?
Don't you want to get air conditioning in this apartment?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.450
Consider your mother and our entire clan... just do it!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.750
Tomorrow you will claim victory against Momo!

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.000
Refreshing
Shiso Tea

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.540
Heh, heh, heh...

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:50.580
Refreshing
Shiso Tea

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.540
This is the perfect cosplay for me.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.290
How did I let myself get dragged into this?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.410
Oh, it's Momo. Good morning!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.330
Good morning.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.080
You seem kind of sleepy,
are you making sure to eat properly?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.410
It's because I stayed up late last night.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:01.910
Huh?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.910
Shamiko...

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.410
I think you got the wrong impression somehow.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:08.830
I have never taken you lightly.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.830
Also, I don't like losing.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.830
So, let's do our best today.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.870
Okay, I'm coming around
to collect your phones and other devices.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.330
Excuse me, Shadow Mistress?

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.660
Could you tell me what that is?

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:30.080
Um, this is... well...

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:35.200
Refreshing
Shiso Tea

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:34.040
Shamiko, just stick with the plan
and tell her that I'm a thermos.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.200
This is...

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:40.620
This is...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.410
...my precious and irreplaceable Ancestor!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.500
It's very important to me,
so please keep it someplace safe.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.290
Shamiko?!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.370
Why, Shamiko?!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.870
Why didn't you tell her I was a thermos?!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.910
Ancestor, I'm sorry.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.000
I'm going to fight this duel fair and square.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.330
SOME DAYS LATER

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.330
Momo.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.580
Name: Shadow Mistress Yuko
World History Final Exam

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.580
How did you do on the test?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:10.830
95 points.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.950
I lost...

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.500
700 dumbbell lifts...

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.750
You don't have to go that hard.
It's an exorbitant amount anyway.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:24.160
Don't patronize me! But at least let me
split it between multiple days!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.620
By the way, Shamiko.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.330
Have you seen the list of top scorers on the final exams?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:32.040
1st) Sion Ogura - 1190 points
2nd) Kumi Shirozaki - 1185 points
3rd) Lilith, the witch who governs over darkness - 1181 points
4th) Mika Kajitani - 1172 points
5th) Mai Kuramoto - 1164 points

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.040
Huh? Ancestor?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.080
Why are you on the list of top scorers?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.330
Well, your teacher was quite accommodating.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:42.540
Ms. Lilith, are you a fan of Mesopotamia?
Would you like to take the test yourself?

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.500
Certainly!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.540
And so, I ended up taking the same test
as the two of you did.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:49.370
While I was at it, I took the tests
for all the other subjects, too!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:51.500
What do you think? I've got a pretty good
head on my shoulders, huh?

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:54.700
I lost to Shamicen...?!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:55.540
Huh?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.950
Momo, are you freaking out?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:03.200
Wait, I know! Ms. Lilith is always hanging out
near Shamiko's bag,

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:05.370
Looking for a home
Please take this bird
REQUIRED EXTRA LESSONS
ENGLISH
Shadow Mistress Yuko

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.370
so all of the textbooks and handouts
for the test were offered to her!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:10.000
She must have cheated during the test by looking
over all of those for the answers in her sealed space!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.370
Isn't that what you did, Ms. Lilith?

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.910
To be honest, that idea never even occurred to me.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.700
You're way more of a schemer than I am.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.080
Yikes...

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.750
That reminds me, Shamiko.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:22.750
Yes?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:26.870
You told the teacher that I was your precious ancestor
and not just a paperweight.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:27.330
Oh, yeah.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:34.580
As a Demon Girl you may be pretty weak, but out of
all the people I've met in my life you're the most...

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:35.290
Well...

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.790
...you're really bad at living life!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.450
Make sure you eat more food! And get more sleep!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.120
And above all, avoid getting yourself sealed!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:43.950
R-right!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:48.290
Your failure has further postponed my great revival
and planned tour of the world's hot springs!

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:53.000
Hold on a second, Ancestor! Is that why you were so
insistent about make me cheat and do other bad stuff?!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.040
I had already heard as much from Anri, but...

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.700
...you really can't bring yourself to be underhanded, huh?

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:58.500
That's not-!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:00.000
D-don't laugh at me!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.870
But in the end, I did lose to Ms. Lilith in the test overall...

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:07.450
Oh, is that a complaint?
I bet you must be frustrated, Magical Girl!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.830
It's not frustrating or anything, really.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.450
Shamiko might not be very strong,
but she's really brainy for a demon!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.700
None of this is going like I had hoped...

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.830
Don't think this means you've won!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.410
Hey... ugh... I'm not a... gah...
dumbbell for you to... ugh... lift like... gah! Ugh!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:29.160
Don't think this means you've won...!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:29.160
Don't give up, Shamiko! Keep your will as tough as
your horns, but aim to be a really openminded demon!

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.660
You said that I was something very important to you.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.370
Even if that was only flattery, it made me really happy.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.450
I wasn't just trying to flatter you.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:42.160
You're the most precious thing in the world to me.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.000
Shamiko...

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:51.910
Hey, Shamiko...

00:11:52.500 --> 00:12:00.250
You already left for school, but you forgot your gym
clothes, your pen case and your most precious thing...

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.080
You're just a forgetful little scamp, aren't you?

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:34.750
The New Refrigerator Dance

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.790
Slide and spin.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.950
Spin, spin, spin!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.250
And then stop.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.290
And finally...

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.200
Hooray~!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.750
Mom's excited because today
the new refrigerator is coming.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.870
You're in high spirits today.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.200
Well, refrigerators these days are simply incredible.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:45.410
The inside is so spacious! And it'll automatically
make all the delicious ice you want!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.950
And it even has a mysterious function
that somehow keeps the vegetable drawers all moist!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:52.000
I'm going to be able to make
so many wonderful meals ahead of time!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.540
Ding-Dong

00:12:55.700 --> 00:13:00.160
I'm sorry, Miss. There's no way this unit
is going to fit through your door.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:03.330
You're going to have to consider
downsizing to a smaller one.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.830
For the rest of the day, all mom did was cry.

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:10.330
And our ancestor got dragged
into drinking a bunch of sake with her.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.410
Tama River

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.580
Good morning!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.250
Good morning, Mikan.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.290
Huh? Isn't Momo with you?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:22.750
I talked Momo out of training so that
we could take a break just for today.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:23.500
Huh?

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:27.660
There's something I want to do together with you
in secret from Momo.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:31.330
Don't tell me... we're doing this in secret because
she's going to pound me down like a pot of tea?!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.290
Oh, ho, ho! Take this! Demon Brewtalizer!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.950
How many pots are you planning to use me for?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.080
At my house we usually reuse the leaves 7 or 8 times...

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.370
Why did the color just drain from your face?!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:44.870
Sakura Cinema

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.370
This is a...

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:44.870
It's a movie theater, Shamiko!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.700
I didn't invite you here for fun, you know.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.000
I want you to help me gain better control over my curse.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.450
Look, this seems like it'll
be scary based on the title alone.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.370
Cossack
Dance of the Dead
Double Feature with
Zombie's Summer Vacation

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.370
This is just a way of training ourselves
to be stronger mentally!

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.830
Cossack
Dance of the Dead

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.540
Cossack Dance of the Dead.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:13:59.910
Double Feature with...

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.660
Double Feature with
Zombie's Summer Vacation

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.660
Zombie's Summer Vacation.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:04.790
Cossack
Dance of the Dead
Double Feature with
Zombie's Summer Vacation

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:05.330
If we spend time getting used to things like this,
then we'll be able to stay relatively cool in bad situ-

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.000
Sorry, I have't met my quota of dumbbell lifts for today!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:07.700
Ah, wait a sec!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:08.620
Gah!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.580
Your tail really is convenient.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.620
It's inconvenient!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.200
And it's surprisingly soft.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.370
Zombie Shark
vs
SUSHI SHARK

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.370
Why did you have to invite me though?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.620
Because I know that doing mental training
would benefit you, too.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.120
It would?

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:24.540
Shamiko... Shamiko... Shamiko...!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.700
Those who are strong and steadfast
have access to more stable magic.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.540
But...

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.830
...this is clearly a horror movie!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:30.160
If you start getting nervous during the showing,
then your curse will take full effect, right?

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:36.160
*Whenever Mikan becomes
 distraught, her curse
{brings great misfortune upon
 the people around her!!

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:36.250
Whenever Mikan becomes distraught, her curse
brings great misfortune upon the people around her.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.120
In that case what's going to happen to me
when I'm sitting right next to you?!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:43.200
I'll pay for your ticket and you can eat
whatever you'd like. I'll even take you to the hospital.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.870
Does that mean a hospital visit is guaranteed?!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:52.830
The Warring States Era
of Cuteness
A Wonderful Gathering
101 Mascots
Zombie Shark
SUSHI SHARK

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.950
Please just come with me! I don't want
to cause any more pain and trouble for Momo!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.370
I promise I'll do my best to stay in control!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.830
Mikan...

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.620
But even I might have an anemic panic attack
if there's lots of gore.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.910
I've gotten used to ghosts lately, though.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.290
Wait, so ghosts don't scare you at all? That's surprising.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.000
Yeah. They don't scare me
because they're just like my Ancestor.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.080
Shamiko?!

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:08.830
You haven't had a proper physical body
for a long time, right Ancestor?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.000
But you always appearing in my dreams and
the way you talk seems like an auditory hallucination.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:15.910
This girl... she's totally put me into the same category
as a ghost that needs busting.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.450
Hey, Magical Girl.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.700
Are movies more fun than watching a DVD?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:22.660
If you enjoy films then I think you'll have a lot of fun.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.290
The screen is huge and the sound system
makes for a totally different experience.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.660
"Popcorn"?

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:33.120
Popcorn

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.450
What is this? Is it yummy?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.120
It's one of the most delicious things you can get
at the theater. Plus it goes great with cola!

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.580
Do you want to try some? Here!
Can I make an offering just like this?

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.790
Yeah, thish doesh go great wiff cola.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:46.000
This is just salted, but they have
a premium version with melted butter.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.040
Hey, Shamiko! Thish can be another part of your training!

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.200
Ancestor!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:54.500
I'm really relieved that you're coming to see it with me.
I was afraid to go all by myself.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.450
No problem. This is actually my first time
seeing a movie at the theater.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.160
Although it's not a genre I particularly like,
I'm still pretty excited!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:08.200
Grain Sentai:
Suihanger The Movie

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:01.700
Here, I got us tickets.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:04.160
I wonder if we need one for your Ancestor, too?

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.910
I'll pay the price for my Ancestor.
I have enough money from working a part-time job.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.660
Excuse me, one ticket for seniors please.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:13.660
Shamiko... are you saying that you think I'm a senior?

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.330
Huh? Seniors are those older than 65, right?

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.120
Well, yeah, but...

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.830
There's nobody in here except for us!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.830
This theater doesn't get a lot of traffic.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.250
On weekday mornings it's pretty much like
you're renting the place out.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.410
I made sure to research it ahead of time!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.450
Now we're free to make any reaction we want
and not get in trouble!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.580
Yeah, but if you react, then doesn't that mean
your curse activates?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:34.950
It's okay. Like those famous
martial artists say, "Be as water."

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:38.950
Although I may seem jumpy on the outside, I promise
you that my heart will be as still as a fish in water.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.160
I really think I've gotten the hang of- EEEEK!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.540
BUZZ!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.540
Mikan! You're going to rip my tail off!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:45.910
Oh, I'm sorry! I couldn't help it!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:47.870
Gotta focus.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.910
Gotta stay focused.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.620
Do you mind if I hold your hand?

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:52.580
S-sure.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.040
Mikan, are you holding your breath?

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.750
I'm holding back the flow of my magic.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.370
Hey punks, make sure
you turn off those cellphones. Got it?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:08.950
Free
Yourself
From Your
Phone

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.750
Damn, enough ringing already.
I'm trying to finish this announcement!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.500
Oh crap, I just answered the phone I should've turned off!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.040
That's why you've gotta totally kill the battery on these things!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.040
Mikan's been holding her breath for over 6 minutes now.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.910
I'll just go ahead and keep
a constant check on her pulse...

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.580
Damn zombies.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.870
Whole town went to hell on my day off.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:28.910
Why don't any of the bullets actually
HIT the heroes?! It's totally unfair!

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.910
Just accept it, Shamiko.
That's how the world works in movies.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:35.250
Don't give up, Zombies!
The protagonist is hiding under the tank!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.750
Shamiko! Your tail is blocking the screen!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.200
Huh? This is actually fun!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:43.870
Meanwhile, Mikan had quietly fainted
and lost consciousness.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.080
Yuko! I actually kept my composure!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.410
I was unconscious for part of it, though.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.870
Wait, why are you crying?!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.330
What's wrong? Did you hurt yourself?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.620
I don't think it's possible for my curse
to attack your stomach or anything!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:01.830
That's not it.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.750
I'm just so touched...

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:06.870
All of the zombies and ghosts,
even though their guts were hanging out,

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.540
they really tried their hardest to overcome
the ridiculous strength of the heroes.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.410
That was the side you were sympathizing with?!

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:14.500
Mikan, I just want to say I'm so happy you invited me.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:18.830
I was scared at first, but I ended up getting so much
out of this experience once we dived in.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.660
O-oh, really? I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:26.330
I haven't really made any friends since I came here,
and I've been so distressed over my curse.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.950
But today I managed to keep it under control.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.120
And that's all because you stayed with me, Yuko.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:30.910
Um!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.660
From now on, I think you should call me "Shamiko"!

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:34.250
Huh?

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.870
Because that's my proper Demon Girl name.
Well, a nickname born from it anyway.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:41.330
Next time, let's go see a movie
that you would actually enjoy instead.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.290
Like this mascot character one.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.290
The Warring States Era of Cuteness
A Wonderful Gathering
101 Mascots

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.370
Mikan and Shamiko, what a surprise.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:45.950
Huh?

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:47.950
Momo! Why are you here?

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.250
And what is up with that headgear?

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.040
Don't tell me my curse caused this?!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.660
No, I'm wearing this because I chose to.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.200
Did you go see the mascot character movie?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.080
Yep. I had nothing else to do today.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.200
Are you a big fan of Miss Tama Sakura?

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.410
No.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.120
It's not like I'm in love with her or anything.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.200
I would just say I feel a strong sense of duty
to support her financially.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.950
Even though you're wearing that fancy light-up hat?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.700
Because Miss Tama Sakura is trying really hard,
but she's still a relatively minor character.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:16.250
She's an official city character, but only has 80 followers.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.790
What's a "follower"?

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.330
But anyway...

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.290
I'm glad to see that you two are getting along.

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.830
I suppose you came here to hang out together.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.700
No! We weren't here to hang out!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.910
I didn't want to cause any more trouble for you, Momo!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:33.620
It's fine. I've done nothing but push you to train every
day. I didn't consider that you might want some time off.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.660
The battery on my sun visor is going to die soon,
so I'm going home.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.790
What kind of reason is that? W-wait!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:45.250
Why do all of my attempts to do what feels right always
end up going the exact opposite of how I intended?

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.250
Whoa-whoa-whoaaaa!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.950
Mikan, please just stay calm! It won't stop! It just keeps popping!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.830
The Magical Girl later took responsibility.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.950
and paid compensation for the broken popcorn machine.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:53.250
The extra popcorn was gathered up by the Demon Girl

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:53.250
Do you think they'd mind if I ate some? Whoaaa!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.620
who took it home and happily ate it for days after.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:57.370
Whoaaa! Whoaaa! Whoa-whoaaaa!

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:04.250
Look, I didn't leave you out
because I wanted to go and have fun.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.080
I'm not bothered by it at all, honestly.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.250
But your eyes look way more dead
than they normally do!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.450
Excuse me, but the cabbage is cooked now.
Would you like me to serve it up?

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:14.910
Hey, Shamiko. Make an offering
of ponzu sauce to me, would you?

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.620
You used to be a lot more energetic back in the day.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.620
The tofu is also ready to eat, by the way.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.540
What happened to you over the last few years?

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.790
I should probably get going.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.410
Wait, Shamiko! Don't go yet!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.450
I have to attend extra lessons at school tonight.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.500
The time hath come.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.200
It's totally fine, really. Let's just start eating.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.200
Don't give up, Shamiko!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.870
Navigate your way through touchy situations and

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.870
Wow. Looks delicious.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:34.500
become a Demon who knows all the best ways to react!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.580
Momo! The hot pot is on this side!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.500
If you don't pay attention, you're going to burn yourself!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.370
Well, tonight's lessons are over.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.540
Just a little longer, then summer vacation will start.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.370
Huh?

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:50.200
That's weird. Maybe I just imagined it.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.330
I thought I felt someone's eyes on me.

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.200
Oh! Shamiko!

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.660
Hello, Ogura.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.500
Did you have extra lessons tonight, Shamiko?

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.580
Yes, I did. What about you?

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:04.450
I was just working on some magic in the lab.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.540
Oh no! I can't say anything yet!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.700
What's the matter?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.830
Sorry, I can't explain yet. I have to keep it secret for now.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:14.080
Oh, but maybe just sharing a little would be okay.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:17.120
Ah, just forget it. Don't mind me. See you again!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:18.790
Bye for now, Shamiko!

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.660
Sure, see you later.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:24.910
I forgot that Ogura from Class C
is in some sort of weird club.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.200
In fact, the other day...

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:30.200
I'm going to be late for the ritual,
so do you mind taking these out, too?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.870
...she said something like that.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.950
At the time, I wondered
what "ritual" she was talking about,

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.620
but I figured it would probably be best
if I just ignored that.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:41.620
Plus, the main theme of that episode was cleaning up
all the garbage and dealing with Mikan's problem.

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:44.370
Besides, it's better if mysteries like that
just stay mysterious.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.790
Hey, Shamiko.

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:50.450
What's on your mind, Ancestor?

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:55.660
Today was sure a whirlwind, but I greatly enjoyed
the excitement of a movie on the big screen.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:57.950
I'm so glad that you had a good time.

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:58.620
Indeed!

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.790
I wouldn't mind if you took me back again sometime.

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.330
That special little seat they had just for me was fabulous!

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:07.200
I was able to make out every minor detail
on that huge screen!

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:10.700
Apparently, there are other theaters
that offer these things called 3D and 4D,

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:14.660
where the screen pops out at you,
and the seats move, and even water shoots out on you!

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:16.290
I'm not sure I'd want the seat to move.

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:17.950
I get dizzy really easily.

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:20.120
Oh, that's a really good point.

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:34.040
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.250
Sassouto shobu shite

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:42.790
Yatchau kedo makechatte

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:44.000
Fugainai nai ne

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.540
Shoushin tenshin

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:46.950
Kibun wa sunsun demo

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.620
Shippo de henji shiyou

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:52.410
Chounai de waiwai shite

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:54.000
Inu made bow-wow de

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.290
Tende meimei de

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:56.750
Shunka shuutou

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.040
Shippai shita tte waraitobasou

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:06.540
Ano koro to onaji you ni kokoro tsumuide

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:12.370
