00:23:24.700 --> 00:23:30.250
Toridori saita iro canvas kakenuke

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:33.120
Sunset da wa, kangaete bakari ja

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:35.370
Sou, mae!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:40.120
Hora, donna iro datte yume kasanete

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.910
Motto asobou ne

00:23:51.000 --> 00:24:06.040
Preview

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:55.370
Next time, I get invited to Ogura's laboratory
where she apparently is doing research on demons.

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:57.790
Shamiko, do you realize what she's going to do to you?
I'm coming with you.

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.200
Is she really going to make a new vessel
for me to inherit? What's it like? Tell me!

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:01.700
Hey Sis, the laptop we borrowed from Momo

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:06.040
The Ancestor Evolves!! A Pair of Glasses Reflect Within a Dark Lab

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:02.950
has been acting up recently.

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:04.410
The next episode is packed with content as usual.

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:05.700
Momo stole my closing line!
